  "created": "2024-02-15T23:16:45.323Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRChat, there are cases where rooms are created with password protection so that only specific users can access them, and there, avatars may be shared illicitly.\n\nCreators holding the copyrights to avatars may find it difficult to access such pedestals and effectively file DMCA claims.\n\nWith the rise of the creator economy, there is concern that such instances may increase.\n\nI would like to see a feature implemented through the VRChat website that allows users to review all pedestals installed within worlds.\n\n・Notes\n\nI received information that pedestals can be concealed using UDON. If it were possible to verify the history of avatars assigned to specific pedestals, such illegal behavior should be preventable.\n\nIn any case, I want to complete the collection of information for DMCA claims entirely on the web.",
